# GazaOS Android Source Manifest

GazaOS is a **HyperOS-Hybrid Lite AOSP 16.2** custom ROM combining upstream stability from **Lunaris-AOSP**, **crDroid**, and **LineageOS** with **GazaOS** system styling, **Gaza Lab**, modular Quick Settings, lightweight HyperOS 4 media, and a **Free Palestine** humanitarian solidarity mission.

## Quick Sync

Initialize the GazaOS 16.2 manifest:

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/GazaOS/android -b 16.2 --git-lfs
```

Sync source trees cleanly (shallow, current branch, no tags):

```bash
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

## Device Trees

GazaOS core ROM repositories stay decoupled from device-specific trees. Add your device, vendor, kernel, and hardware trees (such as Mayu or custom device trees) under `.repo/local_manifests/` or via `breakfast <codename>`:

```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

## Lite Build Configuration Flags

Heavy add-on packages are **disabled by default** (`?= false`) in `vendor/lineage/config/lunaris.mk` to keep system images small and fast. Override any of these in your device makefile (`BoardConfig.mk` / `lineage_<device>.mk`) as needed:

| Flag | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `TARGET_LOW_END_BLUR` | `true` | Lightweight `kawase_darkmoon` blur algorithm |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_AX_THEME_STORE` | `false` | Optional theme store app |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_BATTERY_STATS` | `false` | Optional battery stats viewer app |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_GAMESPACE` | `false` | Optional GameSpace overlay app |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_FREEFORM` | `false` | Optional LMO Freeform & sidebar |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_OMNISTYLE` | `false` | Optional OmniStyle header packs |
| `TARGET_INCLUDE_V4A` | `true` (`!= true` to exclude) | Set `TARGET_EXCLUDE_V4A := true` to omit ViPER4AndroidFX |
| `TARGET_EXCLUDE_HYPEROS_WALLPAPERS` | `false` | Set `true` to omit `GazaOSWallpapers` |
| `WITH_GMS` | `false` | Set `true` to bundle Pixel GMS suite |

## Build

```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch lineage_<device_codename>-bp4a-user
m bacon
```
